<title>UK: Politicians' views on British budget.</title>
<headline>Politicians' views on British budget.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, July 2 - Following is a selection of quotes from leading politicians and members of parliament about the British budget, unveiled on Wednesday by finance minister Gordon Brown -</p>
<p>JOHN MACGREGOR, FORMER CONSERVATIVE MINISTER:</p>
<p>&quot;The first point on public expenditure is the increases for next year in the health service and education are pretty well absolutely identical to the increases Ken Clarke announced for this year under the last Conservative government.&quot;</p>
</text>
